28_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Eakt-Ey3s8UQ7kNvwFvXpll&_nc_oc=Adk-sjfUWqU40_TQ5YYzRnBGYGNiDq5iKRFkpjbGvC7pVvE6u9l_ceYZoDElfEvR8KQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvYek0TGT4wvwKHsX9lcWTZEPbxr7BAI0PKIbTYay99ZQ&oe=69A58640"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1274699934250911", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307315_1274699937584244_8569799209673060711_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=olHBRnCvPV0Q7kNvwExaHZm&_nc_oc=Adms0lN3ugGQ1VCr1jrQIXp4Es2MOT3uAyJdeUnVU62ttdNSBBhVG1pTCrdzAfUS1ws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvz_LCLl1Y_BVbrIi5OqCE8x0xZU4m3UJQ_m7a1iYa1jQ&oe=69A58469"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "\u0411\u0435\u0437 \u0438\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438-4.png", "id": "1709948519886888", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499301053_1709948523220221_7813363641265614497_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UB4PY_wBfWAQ7kNvwG2zpcj&_nc_oc=AdliWnJ1EiPAa-cUoGAOo6b_W1M39Ysuua9jbAIBECEToepHKb7npzOva_1oZikXjJU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsHmCyoyajydBGje1P-oX7dnZ--esH5Mb3oqDw9_jXy7g&oe=69A56EB8"}, "display_name": "Rainbow Hide and Seek", "keywords": ["horror", "survival", "escape", "hide", "seek"], "long_description": "Dive into the eerie world of **Rainbow Hide and Seek** \u2014 a thrilling hide-and-seek adventure designed for Meta Quest 2 / 3 / Pro! Your mission: collect all 10 toys scattered throughout a mysterious house while evading the relentless Rainbow, a quirky yet menacing entity. Explore dimly lit rooms, solve simple puzzles, and use stealth to survive in this immersive VR environment.\n\n# **Features**\n- **Eerie Atmosphere**: Explore dark rooms with stunning visuals.\n- **Unique Antagonist**: Dodge the Rainbow!\n- **Casual Gameplay**: Perfect for players of all levels.\n\nCan you escape before Rainbow finds you? Ideal for casual gamers seeking a fun challenge!", "shor